@host = https://localhost:7185

### Buat akun Budi
POST {{host}}/api/akun
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "namaPemilik": "Budi",
  "nomorHp": "081111111111",
  "saldoAwal": 100000
}

### Buat akun Ani
POST {{host}}/api/akun
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "namaPemilik": "Ani",
  "nomorHp": "082222222222",
  "saldoAwal": 0
}

### Daftar akun (kalau endpoint GET /api/akun sudah ditambahkan)
GET {{host}}/api/akun

### Isi saldo akun 1
POST {{host}}/api/akun/1/isi-saldo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jumlah": 200000,
  "kunciIdempotensi": "isi-001",
  "keterangan": "Isi saldo via minimarket"
}

### Transfer akun 1 ke akun 2
POST {{host}}/api/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "akunAsalId": 1,
  "akunTujuanId": 2,
  "jumlah": 10000,
  "kunciIdempotensi": "uji-001",
  "keterangan": "Bayar makan"
}

### Cek saldo akun 1
GET {{host}}/api/akun/1/saldo

### Cek saldo akun 2
GET {{host}}/api/akun/2/saldo

### Mutasi akun 2
GET {{host}}/api/akun/2/mutasi